contentText:
As part of BLACKPINK , JISOO is one of four. Now, the same goes for her latest campaign with fashion house Self-Portrait, in which she&#8217;s set to star as a quartet of &#8220;cinematic characters&#8221; in a series of short films, which Billboard can exclusively announce.

